{"step_index":318,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:37:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:37:01+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:37:35+02:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n<truncated 499 lines>\n                                <path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path>\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n                            </svg>\n                        </span>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"username\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"Enter username (e.g. admin, officer_zou)\" required autofocus autocomplete=\"username\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Password -->\n                <div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"password\">\n                        <span>Password</span>\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;\">Required</span>\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"input-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"input-icon-left\">\n                            <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                                <path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </span>\n                        <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" class=\"input-control has-action-right\" placeholder=\"Enter password\" required autocomplete=\"current-password\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"input-action-right\" onclick=\"togglePasswordVisibility()\" aria-label=\"Toggle password visibility\" title=\"Show/Hide password\">\n                            <span id=\"eyeIcon\">\n                                <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                                    <path d=\"M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z\"></path>\n                                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n                                </svg>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Submit Button -->\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\" id=\"loginSubmitBtn\">\n                    <span>Sign In & Access Portal</span>\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">➔</span>\n                </button>\n            </form>\n\n            <!-- Quick Demo Accounts Grid -->\n            <div class=\"demo-panel\">\n                <div class=\"demo-panel-header\">\n                    <span>⚡ Demo Accounts Matrix</span>\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;\">(Click card to auto-fill)</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"demo-grid\">\n                    <!-- Admin -->\n                    <div class=\"demo-card\" id=\"cardAdmin\" onclick=\"fillCredentials('admin', 'Admin@12345', this)\">\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-top\">\n                            <span class=\"demo-card-title\">🛡️ Admin</span>\n                            <span class=\"demo-tag demo-tag-admin\">admin</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-desc\">Master Access: Revoke, Registry & Telemetry</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- ZOU Officer -->\n                    <div class=\"demo-card\" id=\"cardZou\" onclick=\"fillCredentials('officer_zou', 'Officer@12345', this)\">\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-top\">\n                            <span class=\"demo-card-title\">🏛️ ZOU Officer</span>\n                            <span class=\"demo-tag demo-tag-zou\">officer_zou</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-desc\">Issue ZOU Degrees & Registry Manager</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Verifier -->\n                    <div class=\"demo-card\" id=\"cardVerifier\" onclick=\"fillCredentials('verifier', 'Verifier@12345', this)\">\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-top\">\n                            <span class=\"demo-card-title\">🔍 Verifier</span>\n                            <span class=\"demo-tag demo-tag-verifier\">verifier</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-desc\">Verify Credentials & AI Scanner</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- NIT Officer -->\n                    <div class=\"demo-card\" id=\"cardNit\" onclick=\"fillCredentials('officer', 'Officer@12345', this)\">\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-top\">\n                            <span class=\"demo-card-title\">🏛️ NIT Officer</span>\n                            <span class=\"demo-tag demo-tag-nit\">officer</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"demo-card-desc\">Accredited Registrar Officer</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Trust Badges Below Card -->\n        <div class=\"auth-footer\">\n            <span class=\"trust-pill\">⛓️ <strong>SHA-256</strong> Blockchain Consensus</span>\n            <span>•</span>\n            <span class=\"trust-pill\">🤖 <strong>Agentic AI</strong> Fraud Shield</span>\n            <span>•</span>\n            <span class=\"trust-pill\">🔒 <strong>Zero-Trust</strong> Role Access</span>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Global App Client Logic -->\n    <script src=\"/js/app.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        function fillCredentials(user, pass, element) {\n            const u = document.getElementById('username');\n            const p = document.getElementById('password');\n            if (u) u.value = user;\n            if (p) p.value = pass;\n\n            // Highlight selected demo card\n            document.querySelectorAll('.demo-card').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active-fill'));\n            if (element) {\n                element.classList.add('active-fill');\n                setTimeout(() => element.classList.remove('active-fill'), 1200);\n            }\n\n            // Hide previous error message\n            const err = document.getElementById('loginError');\n            if (err) err.style.display = 'none';\n\n            if (u) u.focus();\n        }\n\n        function togglePasswordVisibility() {\n            const pwd = document.getElementById('password');\n            const eyeIcon = document.getElementById('eyeIcon');\n            if (pwd.type === 'password') {\n                pwd.type = 'text';\n                eyeIcon.innerHTML = `\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                        <path d=\"M17.94 17.94A10.07 10.07 0 0 1 12 20c-7 0-11-8-11-8a18.45 18.45 0 0 1 5.06-5.94M9.9 4.24A9.12 9.12 0 0 1 12 4c7 0 11 8 11 8a18.5 18.5 0 0 1-2.16 3.19m-6.72-1.07a3 3 0 1 1-4.24-4.24\"></path>\n                        <line x1=\"1\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"23\"></line>\n                    </svg>\n                `;\n            } else {\n                pwd.type = 'password';\n                eyeIcon.innerHTML = `\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                        <path d=\"M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z\"></path>\n                        <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n                    </svg>\n                `;\n            }\n        }\n\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n            if (params.get('notice') === 'verify_required' || params.get('notice') === 'auth_required') {\n                const banner = document.getElementById('noticeBanner');\n                if (banner) banner.style.display = 'flex';\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n"}
{"step_index":319,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:37:35Z","content":"The application has been packaged and is actively running on `http://localhost:8080`.\n\n### Summary of Changes Deployed\n\n1. **Zimbabwe State University Database Population (83 Records Total)**:\n   - Seeded **8 major Zimbabwean State Universities** with **10 distinct students and degree programs each** (80 new records + 3 baseline records):\n     - **University of Zimbabwe (UZ)**: BSc Computer Science, MBChB Medicine, Bachelor of Laws, BSc Civil Engineering, etc.\n     - **National University of Science and Technology (NUST)**: BSc Electronic Engineering, BSc Applied Physics, BCom Actuarial Science, etc.\n     - **Midlands State University (MSU)**: BSc Telecommunications, BSc Human Resource Management, Bachelor of Commerce in Accounting, etc.\n     - **Zimbabwe Open University (ZOU)**:\n       - IT degrees formatted as requested: `ITM 190020`, `ITM 200021`, `ITM 210022`, `ITM 220023`, `ITM 230024`.\n       - Post Graduate Diploma in Education (PGDE) degrees formatted as requested (where first 2 digits represent the year): `EH250001`, `EH240002`, `EH230003`, `EH220004`, `EH210005`.\n     - **Chinhoyi University of Technology (CUT)**\n     - **Bindura University of Science Education (BUSE)**\n     - **Great Zimbabwe University (GZU)**\n     - **Harare Institute of Technology (HIT)**\n   - All 83 records are cryptographically signed and mined onto the simulated blockchain ledger (Blocks #1 through #83).\n   - Lookups work seamlessly across **Certificate Numbers**, **Cryptographic SHA-256 Hashes**, and **Student IDs** (e.g. `ITM 190020` or `EH250001`).\n\n2. **Form & Textbox Styling Overhaul**:\n   - **Full-Width & Responsive Inputs**: Set all `.input-control` fields to `width: 100% !important`, a modern 48px height, 12px border radius, and crisp focus rings (`#4f46e5` indigo with a soft glow) to fix the previously squished/cut-off appearance.\n   - **Modern Input Wrappers & Icons**: Added `.input-wrapper` containers with embedded SVG icons (user avatar, padlock, search magnifying glass) with padded left/right margins.\n   - **Browser Autofill Reset**: Prevented yellow/blue background overrides in WebKit/Blink browsers with an internal `-webkit-autofill` box-shadow lock.\n   - **Interactive Password Visibility Toggle**: Users can click the eye icon inside the password field to toggle between clear text and masked password.\n   - **Interactive Demo Accounts Matrix**: Added a 2x2 clickable grid for `admin`, `officer_zou`, `verifier`, and `officer` that auto-fills credentials into the inputs with visual feedback.\n   - **Professional Enterprise Branding**: Added a frosted-glass header, badge icons, subtle card shadows, and blockchain/AI trust pills.\n\nYou can view the updated portal in your browser at:\n👉 **`http://localhost:8080/login`**"}
